{"seq":1,"slug":"blending-authored","title":"与美术动画融合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-animation/practice/blending-authored","wordCount":1926,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"与美术动画融合\">与美术动画融合</h1><p>最容易毁掉一套程序化动画的，不是求解器写错，而是它和动画师做好的美术动画「打架」：贴地 IK 把精心设计的踏步弹跳压平、注视抢走了过场里转头看人的表演、弹簧骨在攻击的关键帧上多晃了一下破坏了力度。程序化层不是来替代动画的，它是叠在动画<strong>之上</strong>的一层修正。这一篇讲三件让两者和睦共处的工具：骨骼遮罩限范围、混合权重控强度、动画通知择时机。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>融合的第一原则：<strong>程序化动画是加法层，不是替换层</strong>。基底永远是动画系统混合出来的美术姿态（见<a href=\"../foundations/runtime-pose-generation\">运行时姿态生成</a>的流水线 D 步），程序化层在它之上做局部、可控、可关闭的修正。三个维度精确控制这层修正：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[美术动画基底姿态] --&gt; B[程序化层计算修正]&#10;  B --&gt; C[遮罩: 限定作用骨骼&lt;br/&gt;只动腿/只动头]&#10;  C --&gt; D[权重 α: 控制介入强度&lt;br/&gt;0=纯动画 1=全程序化]&#10;  D --&gt; E[通知: 择时开关&lt;br/&gt;动画事件触发]&#10;  E --&gt; F[融合后最终姿态]&#10;  A --&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n  A[美术动画基底姿态] --&gt; B[程序化层计算修正]\n  B --&gt; C[遮罩: 限定作用骨骼&lt;br/&gt;只动腿/只动头]\n  C --&gt; D[权重 α: 控制介入强度&lt;br/&gt;0=纯动画 1=全程序化]\n  D --&gt; E[通知: 择时开关&lt;br/&gt;动画事件触发]\n  E --&gt; F[融合后最终姿态]\n  A --&gt; F</pre><p>下表给出三个工具的分工：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>控制的是</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n<th>典型设置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>骨骼遮罩 bone mask</td>\n<td>哪些骨骼受影响（空间）</td>\n<td>贴地别动手、注视别动腿</td>\n<td>贴地→腿链；注视→头+上脊椎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合权重 α</td>\n<td>影响多强（强度）</td>\n<td>空中别贴地、对话才注视</td>\n<td>空中 α=0，落地 α=1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动画通知 notify</td>\n<td>何时生效（时间）</td>\n<td>攻击帧关弹簧、踏地帧锁脚</td>\n<td>关键帧打点开关 IK</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"骨骼遮罩-把程序化层圈在该管的范围里\">骨骼遮罩：把程序化层圈在该管的范围里</h2><p>遮罩（bone mask / layered blending）规定程序化节点只能修改骨架的某个子集。这是融合的第一道防线——它从空间上把程序化层圈死。</p>\n<p>例子很直接。足部贴地的遮罩只含腿链（髋→膝→踝→脚趾），这样它绝不会碰到手臂和头，攻击动画里挥拳的表演完全不受影响。注视的遮罩只含头与上脊椎几节，不碰下半身的走路。弹簧骨的遮罩只含饰物骨。如果不加遮罩，让 IK 节点理论上能改任意骨骼，一旦求解器在边角情形出怪结果，整副骨架都可能被污染。</p>\n<p>遮罩还能做<strong>软边界</strong>——遮罩权重不是非 0 即 1，可以让影响沿骨链渐变（如上脊椎受注视影响 0.3、脖子 0.6、头 1.0），这正是<a href=\"../ik/look-at-aim\">注视与瞄准</a>里「把旋转分摊到多骨」的实现载体。引擎里这对应 UE 的 Layered Blend Per Bone、Unity Animation Rigging 的分层 Rig 与每约束权重。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混合权重-用-平滑控制介入强度\">混合权重：用 α 平滑控制介入强度</h2><p>遮罩管「哪些骨」，权重管「多强」。每个程序化节点输出的修正姿态，与基底姿态之间用一个权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 插值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>pose</mtext><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>pose</mtext><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mtext>pose</mtext><mtext>proc</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{pose}_{\\text{out}} = \\mathrm{slerp}(\\text{pose}_{\\text{base}},\\ \\text{pose}_{\\text{proc}},\\ \\alpha)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6747em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pose</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1302em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">slerp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pose</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pose</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">proc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 等于完全不介入（纯动画），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 等于完全用程序化结果。关键在于 <strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 几乎从不该是常数，而该随游戏状态平滑变化</strong>。三个经典场景：</p>\n<p>其一，足部贴地的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 随脚是否着地变化——支撑相 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 全力贴地，摆动相（脚在空中）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 让动画完全接管，跳跃腾空时整体降到 0（见<a href=\"../ik/foot-placement\">足部贴地</a>）。其二，注视的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 随情境淡入淡出——进入对话/战斗区淡入到 1，离开淡出到 0。其三，主动布偶受击时把受击部位的物理权重瞬间升高、再随恢复淡回 0（见<a href=\"../dynamics/ragdoll-blending\">布偶混合</a>）。</p>\n<p>权重的<strong>淡入淡出速度</strong>本身是个手感参数：切太快会「啪」地突变（如注视瞬间锁定），切太慢则反应迟钝（脚都该贴地了还在悬空）。用前面提到的帧率无关插值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_t = \\alpha_{t-1} + (1-e^{-k\\Delta t})(\\alpha_{\\text{target}} - \\alpha_{t-1})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1352em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 平滑过渡。这些速度参数怎么调，是<a href=\"../practice/procedural-tuning\">手感调校</a>的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动画通知-让程序化层在对的时刻开关\">动画通知：让程序化层在对的时刻开关</h2><p>遮罩和权重还差一个「择时」的触发源——程序化层该在动画的哪一刻开、哪一刻关？答案是<strong>动画通知（animation notify / event）</strong>：动画师（或程序员）在动画时间轴的特定帧上打点，姿态求值到那一帧时触发回调，去开关某个程序化节点或改其权重。</p>\n<p>典型用法：在走路动画里，动画师在「脚踏地」那一帧打一个 notify，触发该脚的足锁开启（把脚钉在地面），在「脚抬起」帧打另一个 notify 解锁——这让程序化的足锁与美术动画的踏步节奏精确同步，不会出现脚还没抬就被锁住的拖拽感。又如攻击动画在「挥击关键帧」前后打 notify，临时把武器上的弹簧骨权重压低，避免余韵抖动削弱挥击的力度感。再如蒙太奇/过场动画里用 notify 在某帧禁用注视，把表演控制权完全交还给动画师。</p>\n<p>这样三层配合就完整了：<strong>遮罩定空间、权重定强度、通知定时间</strong>。这套机制把程序化层的「介入」变成了动画师可以精确编排的工具，而非一个失控的黑箱。它依赖的求值顺序前提（程序化插在混合之后）见<a href=\"../foundations/runtime-pose-generation\">运行时姿态生成</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"加法姿态-另一种叠加思路\">加法姿态：另一种叠加思路</h2><p>除了用权重在「基底」和「程序化结果」间插值，还有一种更动画师友好的融合方式——<strong>加法姿态（additive pose）</strong>。它存的不是绝对姿态，而是相对某个参考姿态的「差量」（delta）。把一个加法姿态叠加到基底上，就是在基底之上「额外加一点旋转」，而不替换基底。</p>\n<p>加法在融合里很有用：呼吸起伏、受击抖动、瞄准偏移都常做成加法层，叠在走跑动画上而不破坏走跑本身。程序化的余韵、注视偏移也可以输出成加法 delta 再叠加，好处是天然「不抢基底的表演」——它只是锦上添花地加一点。加法层同样受遮罩与权重控制。加法姿态的混合细节属于动画系统的范畴，本 hub 不展开，见<a href=\"../../game-animation-systems/playback-blending/layering-masking\">动画系统的分层与遮罩</a>。融合到底用「插值替换」还是「加法叠加」，取决于程序化层是要「改写」基底（如 IK 必须精确改写脚位置）还是「补充」基底（如注视偏移）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>第一原则：程序化动画是叠在美术动画之上的加法/修正层，不是替换层；基底永远是动画混合结果。</li>\n<li>三个融合工具分工：骨骼遮罩定空间（哪些骨）、混合权重 α 定强度（多强）、动画通知定时间（何时）。</li>\n<li>遮罩把程序化层圈在该管的骨链（贴地→腿、注视→头+上脊椎），并支持软边界渐变（承载注视的多骨分摊）。</li>\n<li>权重 α 几乎从不是常数：随脚着地/情境/受击平滑变化；淡入淡出速度本身是手感参数，用帧率无关插值。</li>\n<li>动画通知让程序化层与美术节奏同步：踏地帧锁脚、攻击帧压弹簧、过场禁注视。</li>\n<li>加法姿态是另一种融合：叠相对差量而非替换，适合呼吸/瞄准偏移/余韵这类「补充而非改写」的需求。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"../foundations/runtime-pose-generation\">运行时姿态生成</a>（融合所依赖的流水线顺序）、<a href=\"../ik/foot-placement\">足部贴地</a>（权重择时的典型）、<a href=\"../ik/look-at-aim\">注视与瞄准</a>（软遮罩承载旋转分摊）、<a href=\"procedural-tuning\">手感调校</a>（淡入淡出速度等参数）。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-animation-systems/playback-blending/layering-masking\">动画系统 — 分层与遮罩</a>（加法姿态与分层混合的底层机制）。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>分层混合、动画通知、加法姿态机制参考 Epic UE5.7 Animation Blueprint / Layered Blend 文档（dev.epicgames.com）与 Unity Animation Rigging 分层 Rig 文档（docs.unity3d.com），2026 年访问。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"与美术动画融合","id":"与美术动画融合"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"骨骼遮罩：把程序化层圈在该管的范围里","id":"骨骼遮罩-把程序化层圈在该管的范围里"},{"level":2,"text":"混合权重：用 α 平滑控制介入强度","id":"混合权重-用-平滑控制介入强度"},{"level":2,"text":"动画通知：让程序化层在对的时刻开关","id":"动画通知-让程序化层在对的时刻开关"},{"level":2,"text":"加法姿态：另一种叠加思路","id":"加法姿态-另一种叠加思路"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"布偶混合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-animation/dynamics/ragdoll-blending"},"next":{"title":"程序化动画性能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-animation/practice/procedural-performance"}}